Synthetic XML Component Description for CalSwc (tools/rtegen RTE-03 host test). Written by hand in the shape
Embedded Coder R2024a (autosar.tlc) exports ParameterReceiver ports, checked against a probe model on 2026-09-17:
PARAMETER-INTERFACE with PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPEs, R-PORT-PROTOTYPE with PARAMETER-REQUIRE-COM-SPEC, arrays as
IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE of category ARRAY (rt_Array_<type>_<n>), fixed point (fixdt) as
APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE with a LINEAR COMPU-METHOD and a DATA-TYPE-MAPPING-SET, and PARAMETER-ACCESS
points in the runnable.
-->
